# The second real crash: bad_alloc on loopTask in a small list copy behind the keyboard
# handler, opening an app while chat's first full sync and the walkie socket run.
expect-crash "bad_alloc"
wait 3000
press enter
wait-text "HOME" 15000
repeat 600
press 2
press left
press 3
wait 200
press left
end-repeat
report no crash so far
